
Server init.
Ibisohoka andika: ['Database test'], umurongo-mushya.

>> db := Maria-DB gishya uwakira: ['localhost'],
	izina-ryukoresha: ['xo'], 
	ijambobanga: ['pass123'],
	izina-ryububikoshingiro: ['xobase'],
	ihuze.

>> ibipimo-byishakisha :=
db ikibazo: ['SELECT UNHEX('CAFE') AS blobby'],
zana: { :row
	Ibisohoka andika: ( row blobby kuva: 0 uburebure: 2 ), umurongo-mushya.
	row blobby rekura.
}.
